sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Istio as Istio Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant REST as OVMS HTTPServerModule<br/>rest_port/TCP HTTP
    participant gRPC as OVMS GRPCServerModule<br/>grpc_port/TCP gRPC
    participant Manager as ServableManagerModule
    participant Runtime as OpenVINO Runtime<br/>in-process
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 1: KServe Inference Request (REST)

    Client->>Istio: POST /v3/v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    Istio->>REST: Forward (TLS terminated upstream)<br/>HTTP/rest_port
    REST->>REST: Validate API key<br/>(if configured)
    REST->>Manager: Route to LLM Servable<br/>via MediaPipe graph
    Manager->>Runtime: Execute inference<br/>(in-process call)
    Runtime-->>Manager: Inference result
    Manager-->>REST: Response payload
    REST-->>Istio: JSON Response
    Istio-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 1b: KServe Inference Request (gRPC)

    Client->>Istio: gRPC InferenceService.ModelInfer
    Istio->>gRPC: Forward gRPC<br/>(InsecureServerCredentials)
    gRPC->>Manager: Route to model servable
    Manager->>Runtime: Execute inference
    Runtime-->>Manager: Inference result
    Manager-->>gRPC: gRPC Response
    gRPC-->>Istio: Response
    Istio-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 2: Model Loading from Cloud Storage

    Manager->>Storage: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS<br/>AWS IAM / GCP / Azure credentials
    Storage-->>Manager: Model files
    Manager->>Runtime: Load model into<br/>OpenVINO Runtime

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 3: HuggingFace Model Pull

    Manager->>HFHub: Clone/download model repo<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS<br/>Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HFHub-->>Manager: Model artifacts + config
    Manager->>Manager: Optional: optimum-intel<br/>model conversion
    Manager->>Runtime: Load converted model
